it works great for shoes. Then I give everything a good rinse, make sure to scrub the insides as well, rinse again to make sure there's no soap residue left behind. After cleaning, I did notice some scuff marks on both the toes and soles of the shoe, so for this I like to use a magic eraser, give them a quick scrub down, and then rinse with a damp towel, and they were completely gone. To get them dry as quickly as possible, I just wrap them up in a few towels. Now this was definitely the most satisfying part of the job. These laces were really dirty, as you can see in the water, but they absolutely cleaned up great. Now these chucks are nice and clean and ready for their next journey.", "history": [{"date": "2026-07-18", "plays": 87187, "likes": 2530, "comments": 20}, {"date": "2026-07-19", "plays": 87883, "likes": 2551, "comments": 20}, {"date": "2026-07-26", "plays": 106245, "likes": 3060, "comments": 27}, {"date": "2026-08-02", "plays": 117837, "likes": 3685, "comments": 28}], "still_climbing": false, "hook_type": "Personal Experience", "is_relevant": true}, {"shortCode": "DaoMPC3PSuA", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DaoMPC3PSuA/", "caption": "What sound does a spray bottle make?", "timestamp": "2026-07-10T21:49:13.000Z", "videoDuration": 22.242, "videoPlayCount": 58116, "videoViewCount": 780, "likesCount": 518, "commentsCount": 6, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-waw2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/736493677_18443302936140899_6600193150592525971_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-waw2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHW64X4FgoeR6x2VIEkhI-EVlIQBNAsgkkmcT2Ttbregh0RQs17GVJrquWjeUyjnGo&_nc_ohc=WxtcSvgZD98Q7kNvwGpLPME&_nc_gid=MiKuujsQcoRy1_Fpnlkgxw&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQGuxR9Vp9GAlDbrOD7ZF2djE3v5vTgSWZKUIXOEk8wKGQ&oe=6A74F543&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-waw2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMuHvIuAU4X7zX2Zau_BH4EM4B5sv4yFBNrHXqfFbZsYUA6-FHsOaEKNNfMgfchSo0-mSC12ubRs-QKkUDfN9EkMAmmfBywctRcGGI.m